Stories of Legend Opening (EN)=
{{Opening|1=
Not long after the Battle Cats conquered the [[Empire of Cats|world]],<br> they finally made their next move.

I truly believed they just wanted to<br>
blend into our world and<br>
live a cozy and peaceful life...<br>
...<br>
I was so naive.<br>


Suddenly, every power plant<br>
on the planet was seized by<br>
the forces of the Cat Army!<br>

They were trying to feed<br>
all that power into one place!<br>


For what reason, you ask?<br>
Time travel, of course!<br>



How did I learn this? Well, the other day,<br>
I happened to sit next to the PR Manager<br>
for the Cat Army at a milk bar.<br>
We hit it off, and him being a Cat,<br>
he completely ignored his NDA,<br>
leaking all sorts of top secret info.<br>


So, the truth is, I've known<br>
about this plan for a while...<br>
But, you know, between visiting my folks<br>
and the sequel to my favorite game dropping,<br>
I've been completely swamped and<br>
forgot to alert anyone about it.<br>


"To free the Mythic Cat helpers of old,<br>
sealed away by nefarious conspiracy,<br>
we must transcend space and time!"<br>
...I seem to recall the cat shouting that while<br>

we knocked back frosty pints of half-and-half.<br>




I think we were snacking on sardines at the<br>
time. I think they were a little off, though.<br>


Anyway, the time travel was a massive success,<br>

and the Battle Cats all departed for a new world.<br>


And guess what? They made sure to<br>
safely shut down all the power plants,<br>
and even left a sticky note saying<br>
"Thank you!"

It's just like I said before:<br>
The Battle Cats are pretty good at heart!<br>


Oh, right. I should mention...<br>
You know [[The Cat God (Special Cat)|Cat God]], right?<br>Yeah, THAT Cat God.<br>

It turns out he's a millennial. Which means...<br>
He won't exist in the past, I guess?<br>
}}

