Stories of Legend Ending (EN)=
{{Opening|1=
And so, having freed the Mythic Cats<br>
the Battle Cats returned to their<br>
proper homes at the present day.

Welcome home, The Battle Cats!

I was a little bummed the only souvenir they brought<br>
back after all that epic time travel was nothing but<br>
a box of duty-free macadamia nut chocolates, though.

At long last,

The Battle Cats and their new Mythic Cat comrades<br>
will usher in a radiant and joyous new era for all!


...or so I thought.<br>
Once again, things didn't quite work out that way.

To my surprise,

it turns out<br>
The Battle Cats instead had traveled to<br>
the completely wrong era!

I bumped into the Cat Army's PR guy at<br>
the milk bar again, and he spilled all the details
<br>
without me even having to ask.

He said the Cats started to suspect<br>
they'd travelled to the wrong time period when<br>
the Cats around them were all<br>
wearing neon windbreakers and acid-wash jeans...



What's more, let slip that in the end, the Cats they'd rescued<br>
weren't actually the Mythic Cats, but their descendant!

Plus, that shadowy conspiracy was<br>
now researching how to awaken [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] powers.

So, the Cats had no choice but to gear up to time travel<br>
once again and at last free the TRUE Mythic Cats. <br>



Oh yeah - check this out!<br>
All that online buzz about a massive gathering<br>
of Cats at the base of Mt. Everest...<br>
That's what that was all about!

And so, the Cats' second attempt at time travel<br>
was once again another flawless success,<br>
and The Battle Cats have now departed for<br>
an era even more ancient and distant.

Anyway,<br>



Don't sweat the small stuff,<br>
The Battle Cats!<br>
You got this,<br>
The Battle Cats!

Backward to an age of Uncanny Legends,<br>
The Battle Cats!<br>








[[File:Theend.png|500px|The end! Thank you for playing !!]]
}}
